{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/50702fbda13c9543de3fdcf9e318a867.poster.avif?t=1756975221\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/50702fbda13c9543de3fdcf9e318a867.webm?t=1756975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You've overslept, missing the first lecture of the day! Your class assignment is due, but what time were you supposed to meet your study group again? These are everyday little problems that require some problem-solving, minor sleuthing, and resolution! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/c0d1c90f08fcc3614e337322c993bfd4.poster.avif?t=1756975221\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/c0d1c90f08fcc3614e337322c993bfd4.webm?t=1756975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Problems is a refreshing departure from the typical narrative of grandiose conflicts and complex villainy. It invites players to delve into a world where detective work is about connecting with friends, understanding the small yet significant issues of daily life, and finding joy in the simplicity of resolution. This game isn't about saving the world; it's about enriching it, one little problem at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This charming title, challenges players to solve mysteries around minor inconveniences, everyday misunderstandings, and of course, little problems.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2653470?t=1756975221","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756975221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/7fef54fc92fff186b429cd4010c20c3fd3ad5696/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756975221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/7fef54fc92fff186b429cd4010c20c3fd3ad5696/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756975221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/ad6ad5660f866b7c25612351a685012e.avif?t=1756975221\" data-has-big width=800 height=390 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/50702fbda13c9543de3fdcf9e318a867.poster.avif?t=1756975221\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/50702fbda13c9543de3fdcf9e318a867.webm?t=1756975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You've overslept, missing the first lecture of the day! Your class assignment is due, but what time were you supposed to meet your study group again? These are everyday little problems that require some problem-solving, minor sleuthing, and resolution! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/c0d1c90f08fcc3614e337322c993bfd4.poster.avif?t=1756975221\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/extras/c0d1c90f08fcc3614e337322c993bfd4.webm?t=1756975221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Problems is a refreshing departure from the typical narrative of grandiose conflicts and complex villainy. It invites players to delve into a world where detective work is about connecting with friends, understanding the small yet significant issues of daily life, and finding joy in the simplicity of resolution. This game isn't about saving the world; it's about enriching it, one little problem at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This charming title, challenges players to solve mysteries around minor inconveniences, everyday misunderstandings, and of course, little problems.</p>","developers":["Posh Cat Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/header.jpg?t=1756975221","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024, Amplified Games and Maximum Production Studios, all rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo @ 1.86 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics